WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.667 --> 00:00:03.801
James, can I get some Thank You Note writing music, please?

00:00:03.801 --> 00:00:06.267
♪♪

00:00:06.267 --> 00:00:07.634
-Wow.

00:00:10.367 --> 00:00:12.934
-Thank you, "The Watcher," for showing me

00:00:12.934 --> 00:00:15.868
what it would look like if Michael Myers was into Zillow.

00:00:15.868 --> 00:00:17.868
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:21.634 --> 00:00:23.067
♪♪

00:00:23.067 --> 00:00:26.534
Thank you, couples costumes, for being the cutest way

00:00:26.534 --> 00:00:28.434
to tell the world you had an argument.

00:00:28.434 --> 00:00:30.567
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:33.334 --> 00:00:35.667
-"Wear it."

00:00:35.667 --> 00:00:37.000
♪♪

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:39.734
-Thank you, giant skeletons, for making it look like

00:00:39.734 --> 00:00:41.634
my neighbors are really into Halloween

00:00:41.634 --> 00:00:43.667
or really not into Shaq.

00:00:43.667 --> 00:00:45.601
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:47.067 --> 00:00:48.501
-Wow!

00:00:50.767 --> 00:00:52.200
♪♪

00:00:52.200 --> 00:00:55.934
-Thank you, adult twins, for kind of being a scary costume

00:00:55.934 --> 00:00:57.167
any day of the year.

00:00:57.167 --> 00:00:59.200
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:02.634 --> 00:01:03.701
♪♪

00:01:03.701 --> 00:01:05.067
[ Laughs ] Thank you,

00:01:05.067 --> 00:01:07.300
dogs willing to wear Halloween costumes,

00:01:07.300 --> 00:01:09.067
for looking at their owners and going,

00:01:09.067 --> 00:01:11.300
"Sure. I'll do it. It seems like they need this."

00:01:11.300 --> 00:01:13.133
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:15.334 --> 00:01:17.667
"What more can I give?"

00:01:17.667 --> 00:01:19.601
-"Live it up."

00:01:19.601 --> 00:01:21.000
♪♪

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:24.033
-Thank you, houses that give out full-sized candy bars,

00:01:24.033 --> 00:01:26.000
for letting me know which families on the block

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:28.100
are doing pretty, pretty good this year.

00:01:28.100 --> 00:01:30.133
There you have it, everybody. Those are my Thank You Notes.

